   "widgets_values": [
    "Modern American comic book illustration, bold confident black ink linework, dynamic cel shading with crisp graphic shadow shapes, vibrant saturated colors, professional comic cover quality.\n\nFull-body character design of an original superhero, an adult man with an athletic build, standing facing the viewer in a confident heroic stance, feet shoulder-width apart, arms relaxed and held slightly away from his body, the whole figure visible from head to toe with empty space around it. He wears a sleek form-fitting suit in hot magenta and deep navy with electric cyan accent lines along the arms and sides, navy gloves and boots, and a short sunset-orange cape that hangs behind his shoulders. A navy domino mask covers his eyes, with glowing cyan eye lenses; short dark hair. On his chest is a bold geometric emblem: a white diagonal dumbbell inside a cyan diamond. Plain flat pale grey background, no scenery, no text, no logos, no watermark."
   ],
   "title": "Prompt A_comic"
